# Worf, Honor-Bound Warrior: "Tap two untapped artifacts and/or creatures you control: Put a +1/+1 counter on Worf.
# Activate only as a sorcery." (CR 118.3, 602.5d) A plain artifact (Mox Pearl) and a plain creature (Worf himself) both
# count, and the cost is exactly two: the Ornithopter is left untapped. Once the Mox is tapped it is no untapped artifact,
# so Worf can't be activated again with it and the Ornithopter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Worf, Honor-Bound Warrior
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Mountain x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

